エゴ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"157"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Official name: Sexaroid Experimental Model E-5"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Attributes: Android, sexophobia, stylish, rare"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Talents: Sex (Reluctantly, she was made for it, but doesn't like it.)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A prototype sexaroid of Electro-Electronics, Inc."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her model number is \"E-5 (ERECT-type5)\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ego is the 5th and lasted experimental model following her sisters type 1-4. For some reason, she has developed an ego of her own that her sisters don't have. Because of this, she dislikes sex."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She appears to be an expressionless android, but she actually has human feelings and emotions. Questioning her own role, she escaped from the research institute of her own accord."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c113941"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エレクトエレクトロニクス社（EREL社）の試作実験機セクサロイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"型番号は『E-5（ERECT-type5）』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉妹機として、現在はtype1～4までいて、エゴは5番目となる予定の最新型の試作実験機となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何の因果か、他の姉妹機にはない自我が芽生え、そのせいでセックスに嫌悪感を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無表情で人間味のないアンドロイドに見えるが、実は人間味があり、感情を持っていて、自分の役割に疑問を持ったエゴは、自分の意志で研究所の外へと逃げ出した。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24235","sourceWorkId":"33014","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エレクトエレクトロニクス社（EREL社）の試作実験機セクサロイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"型番号は『E-5（ERECT-type5）』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉妹機として、現在はtype1～4までいて、エゴは5番目となる予定の最新型の試作実験機となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何の因果か、他の姉妹機にはない自我が芽生え、そのせいでセックスに嫌悪感を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無表情で人間味のないアンドロイドに見えるが、実は人間味があり、感情を持っていて、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の役割に疑問を持ったエゴは、自分の意志で研究所の外へと逃げ出した。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"115500"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24235","sourceWorkId":"33014","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"157 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24235","sourceWorkId":"33014","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24235","sourceWorkId":"33014","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24235","sourceWorkId":"33014","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"hip":[{"comparisonValue":"38","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c113941","value":"38"},{"comparisonValue":"86","scope":"sourceWork","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24235","sourceWorkId":"33014","value":"86"},{"comparisonValue":"86","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"115500","value":"86"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/396b66855f3b208c52391f4d65aa0a246d8f133e1fb166efc86ad2bfc3e33977.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/37b324364763a494e8417b88b8881f7031d694248ca8a28301021a7eaaea7752.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桐村まり","creatorId":"vndb:s1549","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1549","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1549","name":"桐村 まり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:393879:115500:23768:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies